{"ID":"20240304100230-dwa0rbm","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240304100230-dwa0rbm","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240304100230-dwa0rbm\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312150104-yc51r3v\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312150118-0ulloo9\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:700,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312150157-rnzdul3\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:92,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:92\u0026#125;","title":"【大陷胸汤】","type":"doc","updated":"20240312150157"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240312150104-yc51r3v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150104-yc51r3v","updated":"20240312150104"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第一百四十八条。"}]},{"ID":"20240312150104-x9uz8ba","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150104-x9uz8ba","updated":"20240312150104"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"原文：「太阳病」,脉浮而动数,浮则为风,数则为热,动则为痛,头痛发热,而微汗出,及恶寒者,表未解也,医反下之,动数变迟,客气动膈,膈内拒痛,短气躁烦,心中懊恼,胃中空虚,阳气内陷,心下因鞕,则为「结胸」,「大陷胸汤」主之。若不「结胸」,但头汗出,余处无汗,剂颈而还,小便不利,身必发黄也。"}]},{"ID":"20240312150104-3wf4gri","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150104-3wf4gri","updated":"20240312150104"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"浮，代表病在表。数，脉动很快。“头痛发热,而微汗出,”桂枝汤症。如果恶寒项强,葛根汤症。有汗就不是麻黄汤症。这个应该是解表，结果“医反下之,动数变迟。”"}]},{"ID":"20240312150104-xu6jb6v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150104-xu6jb6v","updated":"20240312150104"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"心下就是胃的这一带，中脘穴与心蔽骨中间，这个地方是胸阳，阳气下降的地方，如果「结胸」，代表被痰、水，还有热，梗到这个地方，才造成结胸，所以我们开处方的时候，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"祛痰、去热、去水"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"三种药合在一起，才能把这个结胸去掉。为什么"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"用白蜜，就是能够解毒，滋润津液"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240312150104-e91zf2j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150104-e91zf2j","updated":"20240312150104"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"寒在表，里面大便便秘，攻下，阳气往下走，阳气就下陷，下到胸膈这个地方，堵在这个地方。有的时候不会，如果你误下，病人变成口渴，慢慢胃气恢复了，喝些水慢慢就恢复了。有的回不来就变成结胸。"}]},{"ID":"20240312150104-90yxv5i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150104-90yxv5i","updated":"20240312150104"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"“若不「结胸」,但头汗出,余处无汗,剂颈而还,小便不利,身必发黄。”因为你"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"误下，把肠胃的营养攻掉了，血的源头没了，这个时候看到身体发黄的现象，比如黄疸"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。流的汗就是靠肠胃里面津液，源头还是来自食物。"}]},{"ID":"20240312150104-ztzerz2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150104-ztzerz2","updated":"20240312150104"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"针灸讲过，水和食物残渣在大肠走，小肠火一烧，大肠水就往上走。膀胱贴到小肠，小肠是火，在后面烧，膀胱里面水气化入肝。肝排出胆汁有水。这些水的源头都来自大肠。应该发表，结果你攻下，肠子里面好的坏的食物水统统被你攻掉了，水一没有，马上看到血的颜色。"}]},{"ID":"20240312150104-246tix4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150104-246tix4","updated":"20240312150104"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肝有问题，不单单是看到身黄。鲜黄是胆，暗黄是肝脏受伤了。如何知道肝脏有问题，常常晚上一点到三点醒过来，肝有问题。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"肺是白色，心是赤色，肺比较多，心脏比较少，配在一起是粉红色。手掌是上焦的地方，所以常人手掌掌面是粉红色。如果肝有问题，长东西，肝有实症，硬化或长肿瘤。身上血回到心脏，肝脏里面已经有东西在里面了，容积变小了，这时很多的血回肝脏，一看已经有东西了，大量血进入心脏，红色加多，白色就变少了，手掌就开始红，肝病越来越严重，手掌慢慢变成暗红"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240312150104-yly3ghx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150104-yly3ghx","updated":"20240312150104"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"大陷胸汤方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312150104-cxo5xqu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150104-cxo5xqu","updated":"20240312150104"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"大黄六两去皮，芒硝一升，甘遂一钱"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312150104-rrubena","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150104-rrubena","updated":"20240312150104"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"右三味,以水六升,先煮大黄,取二升,去滓,纳芒硝,煮一二沸,纳甘遂末,温服一升,得快利,止后服。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312150104-afsjcro","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150104-afsjcro","updated":"20240312150104"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大陷胸汤比丸要强。这里甘遂等于是生用。甘遂下去一定会上吐下泻。临床看泻的比较多，而且是泻水是从大便出来。"}]},{"ID":"20240312150104-i2axddk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150104-i2axddk","updated":"20240312150104"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"剂量大黄四钱，芒硝两钱，分两包，每包一钱。甘遂生用。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312150104-8li43wh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150104-8li43wh","updated":"20240312150104"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4——3"}]},{"ID":"20240312150104-nmo6p5y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150104-nmo6p5y","updated":"20240312150104"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大陷胸汤比丸剂量少，当处方越少，越骏的时候，力量越强。"}]},{"ID":"20240312150104-zasbq91","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150104-zasbq91","updated":"20240312150104"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大陷胸汤使用时机，结胸证有二，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"第一个，是热实结胸，第二个是寒实结胸"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。大陷胸汤症是用在热实结胸，病人是热，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"舌苔是黄的，很厚，人都是气色很旺很亮，光鲜亮丽声音很大，焦躁，都是热症。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"脉是浮数也是热。张仲景一直强调寸和关，因为关是指肚子中间，寸在关之上，结胸结在这个地方，你只要确定他是热实结胸，这个实里面可能是肿瘤，积痰生瘤或者淤血生瘤，都有可能。十枣汤也是一种结胸的症状，但是十枣汤完全是水积在里面，病人咳嗽很厉害，但坐不得卧，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"肺底下积水，是十枣汤症"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240312150104-ldlgc7c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150104-ldlgc7c","updated":"20240312150104"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肺里面化脓样的时候，你如果遇到病人西医诊断是肺癌，但是你看他是热实结胸，照样用大陷胸汤。"}]},{"ID":"20240312150104-7h1wtam","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150104-7h1wtam","updated":"20240312150104"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如果结到肠中，大承气汤，后面阳明篇会介绍。"}]},{"ID":"20240312150104-mb7mqd4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150104-mb7mqd4","updated":"20240312150104"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"过去经方家，除了小儿胸满心下石鞕，肺脓疡，脑模样重症的时候都可以使用。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"只要小孩子痰一直在哪呼噜呼噜，呼吸很短，一直发热，痰潮壅塞，眼睛呆滞，都瞪直了，摸到脉都很数，身上很烫，只要是热实结胸，只要有需要，统统可以使用大陷胸汤，只是剂量多寡而已"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240312150104-vimcn6l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150104-vimcn6l","updated":"20240312150104"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【勿误药室方函口诀】是日本经方家在用。"}]},{"ID":"20240312150157-zaupimg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150157-zaupimg"}},{"ID":"20240312150157-d44ciqb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150157-d44ciqb","updated":"20240312150157"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第一百四十九条。"}]},{"ID":"20240312150157-pq24dvx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150157-pq24dvx","updated":"20240312150157"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"原文：「伤寒」六七日,「结胸」热实,脉沉而紧,心下痛,按之石鞕者,「大陷胸汤」主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240312150157-xuon3fe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150157-xuon3fe","updated":"20240312150157"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"心下痛,按之石鞕者。心下就是胃的地方，非常硬，硬邦邦的一个。"}]},{"ID":"20240312150157-rnzdul3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150157-rnzdul3","updated":"20240312150157"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"伤寒误下结胸。我们有伤寒中风温病，这里指的是伤寒，应该是麻黄汤症，结果被误下产生的结胸。这是热实来源。大陷胸汤一般来自该用麻黄汤的时候不用，把他用成承气汤，或者怎么样攻下了，产生热实。"}]},{"ID":"20240312150132-x4uys1e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150132-x4uys1e"}},{"ID":"20240312150132-ga62w94","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150132-ga62w94","updated":"20240312150132"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第一百五十一条。"}]},{"ID":"20240312150132-dojkd3h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150132-dojkd3h","updated":"20240312150132"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"原文：「太阳病」,重发汗,而复下之,不大便五六日,舌上燥而渴,日哺所小有潮热,从心下至少腹鞕满而痛不可近者,「大陷胸汤」主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240312150132-nvxawdt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150132-nvxawdt","updated":"20240312150132"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「太阳病」,发汗太多,又攻下,造成病人五六天不大便，被你清干了。发汗汗已经虚掉了，干掉了还把他攻下了，整个没有了，被你攻下了。病人只要燥渴出现，黄昏的时候，三点到五点有潮热的现象，从心下至少腹鞕满而痛不可近者,也是「大陷胸汤」。"}]},{"ID":"20240312150132-wkdx9y8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150132-wkdx9y8","updated":"20240312150132"}},{"ID":"20240312150132-84ofqdm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150132-84ofqdm","updated":"20240312150132"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以大陷胸汤不单单是横跨胸下，直的从心一直到腹部来，"}]},{"ID":"20240312150132-3s6mapb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150132-3s6mapb","updated":"20240312150132"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"腹诊可以知道，你摸蹦的非常紧。从"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"心下胃的地方到少腹，鞭满，整个硬邦邦的，你一压就知道，大陷胸汤症。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312150132-kqi2poc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150132-kqi2poc","updated":"20240312150132"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这种情形会出现的原因就是因为本来是太阳证，医生给他发汗，发完汗又给他清大便，吃完后变成这样子。"}]},{"ID":"20240312150132-mb8304o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150132-mb8304o","updated":"20240312150132"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以大陷胸汤症我们可以制造出来。麻黄本来开三钱就够了，一两下去，开麻黄一两不会有事，当你要发汗，麻黄开一两的时候，杏仁也开一两，你"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"只要麻黄跟杏仁是等量，麻黄永远不会出事。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312150132-15m6fjl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150132-15m6fjl","updated":"20240312150132"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"心下痞硬直的一直到少腹，都是大陷胸汤症。"}]},{"ID":"20240312150117-qbxfgeb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150117-qbxfgeb"}},{"ID":"20240312150118-4b9wtbv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150118-4b9wtbv","updated":"20240312150118"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第一百六十四条。"}]},{"ID":"20240312150118-o7xwchf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150118-o7xwchf","updated":"20240312150118"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"原文：「伤寒」五六日,呕而发热者,「柴胡汤证」具,而以他药下之,「柴胡证」仍在者,复与「柴胡汤」,此虽已下之,不为逆,必蒸蒸而振,却发热汗出而解；若心下满而鞭痛者,此为「结胸」也,「大陷胸汤」主之：但满而不痛者,此为「痞」,「柴胡」不中与也,宜「半夏泻心汤」。"}]},{"ID":"20240312150118-kxobikn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150118-kxobikn","updated":"20240312150118"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"柴胡证具备却没有用柴胡，反而用其他药攻下导致病情变化的，柴胡症若在，还是可以用柴胡汤对治；如果心下满而鞭痛的，为结胸，用大陷胸汤；满而不痛的，为痞，用半夏泻心汤；"}]},{"ID":"20240312150118-f74t8nr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150118-f74t8nr","updated":"20240312150118"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在正式介绍泻心汤之前，我要把结胸证再重复一遍，免得大家弄错。"}]},{"ID":"20240312150118-6tf44hq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150118-6tf44hq","updated":"20240312150118"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240305084124-s6n4py0.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240312150118-fvg4hpx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150118-fvg4hpx","updated":"20240312150118"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"结胸，前面介绍的热实结胸，大陷胸汤与大陷胸丸有差异的。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"用大陷胸汤剂的时候，结胸的症状在心下鞭硬有两种，一种是心蔽骨正中间下非常强硬痛，第二个是从心下一直痛到关元，这个痛是往下直着走的，大陷胸汤症"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。所以病人结胸的时候，你摸到有硬块，可能他被判定是肺脓疡，可能是淋巴癌，乳癌，不管病名是什么，内症，结胸结在这边，有这个症状，大陷胸汤证。大陷胸汤里面的芒硝，不单单是去干燥的大便，芒硝是攻坚的。神农本草经里面写的咸味的药，都可以攻坚；"}]},{"ID":"20240312150118-zuvbl7n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150118-zuvbl7n","updated":"20240312150118"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"大陷胸丸不是，大陷胸丸心下痞，但它是往上走的，痛一直往上升，大陷胸丸。因为往上升，所以我们用丸剂慢慢吞下去，用汤剂走太快了，还来不及走"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。结果病人是大陷胸汤症，你开成大陷胸丸，病人是大陷胸丸症你开成大陷胸汤。都有的不对症，你一点之差，就没有办法做到一剂知的效果。"}]},{"ID":"20240312150118-psur3nm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150118-psur3nm","updated":"20240312150118"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 但"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"满而不痛者,此为「痞」,"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这是结胸和痞区分开了。结胸拒按，因为他非常硬，像鞭痛，摸上去硬邦邦一个。满而不痛，摸上去软软的，按他不痛，这是痞。"}]},{"ID":"20240312150118-lwn838a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150118-lwn838a","updated":"20240312150118"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「柴胡」不中与也,宜「半夏泻心汤」。"}]},{"ID":"20240312150118-r7xm6cf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150118-r7xm6cf","updated":"20240312150118"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"基本上心下痞和结胸，起因都是被伤寒误下，不应该下被下了，才会产生结胸，心下痞。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"痞症出现是平常肠胃就不好的人。表病，还没有治，被攻下了。表邪下陷造成心下痞。肠胃很好的人反而不会有心下痞。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312150118-dwxcxoe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150118-dwxcxoe","updated":"20240312150118"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"结胸，痛往上走大陷胸丸，痛往下走，大陷胸汤。"}]},{"ID":"20240312150118-uv7ob9y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150118-uv7ob9y","updated":"20240312150118"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"半夏泻心汤方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312150118-1671g14","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150118-1671g14","updated":"20240312150118"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"半夏半斤洗，黄芩三两，干姜三两，甘草三两，人参三两，黄连一两，大枣十二枚劈。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312150118-m3c2vlc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150118-m3c2vlc","updated":"20240312150118"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"右七味,以水一斗,煮取六升,去滓,再煮取三升,温服一升,日三服。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312150118-hempg4m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150118-hempg4m","updated":"20240312150118"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"人参、甘草、大枣、干姜，这是张仲景滋阴的药。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"最轻的干姜甘草大枣，中级的白芍干姜甘草大枣，加重的人参甘草大枣干姜"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。张仲景不用其他的补药，所谓经方是治病的经典之方，经方是治病用的。张仲景用补药是因为病情的发展，造成病人津液不够了，才会使用。心下痞就是被误下了，本来该发表结果被误下，造成病人肠胃津液不够了。"}]},{"ID":"20240312150118-r5f8plz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150118-r5f8plz","updated":"20240312150118"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个时候甘草，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"在治疗肠胃的时候用生甘草，不用炙甘草。当发现病人有寒的时候，才会用到炙甘草"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，心脏不够力的时候。甘草生用有几个好处，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"第一个甘草能够蓄水"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。因为肠胃津液没有了，我们希望补进去津液蓄在里面，人参放进去的时候，我们就不用炙甘草，只用生甘草。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"第二个甘草本身能解毒"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，按照神农本草经解百毒，就是食物的毒。肠胃不好的用生甘草蓄水，津液就会补回去，干姜就是胃里面寒的，我们用干姜，干姜能够温中。黄芩三钱的话，黄连是一钱，半夏的目的，因为他"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"认为胃周围有水"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。呕吐有恶心，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"胃的周围，不在胃里面，周围有水结在这边，用半夏"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，所以小柴胡汤里面我们会用半夏。小柴胡汤是用在胃跟脾中间网膜，三焦油网，用柴胡加半夏。半夏的主要功能是把围绕在胃的周围的水排掉。如果这个水是在胃里面，干姜排掉了，如果是有寒还有水，我们把干姜跟生姜并用，就可以把胃里面的水排掉，你要是在胃里面排水，不能加生甘草下去，甘草有蓄水的功能，排水肿的时候都不用甘草，甘草会把水累积起来。"}]},{"ID":"20240312150118-b1dxpxj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150118-b1dxpxj","updated":"20240312150118"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"半夏泻心汤，就是表邪误下以后，跑到肠胃里面来。黄芩跟黄连，一般"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"黄芩用三钱，黄连用一钱"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。半夏利水把胃周围的水排掉，用半夏的症状一定是病人不渴。同样是止呕，但半夏是不渴。黄芩黄连是去热的药，黄连解血里面的毒素，黄芩是解肝胆三焦淋巴系统里面的热毒，热本身被中医定义为毒，就是说你东西累积在里面排不出去，要想办法疏通他，就会用到黄芩。"}]},{"ID":"20240312150118-0ulloo9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150118-0ulloo9","updated":"20240312150118"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"治疗肠胃方面的病大部分是空腹的时候吃药"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。这个汤剂，用粉剂也可以。主要的症状，因为里面有热，看舌头最清楚，舌苔上面是黄湿的，舌苔代表胃，如果舌苔很黄很厚，就可以吃黄芩黄连了。人不可以积寒，也不可以积热。所以在寒热中间调整的时候，我们在一发觉到有点热就把它去掉，不要等到大热再去，小毛病出现就开始调整。如果是黄但是很干很燥，就不是黄芩黄连了，就是石膏，因为里面是燥热。所以从舌苔也可以分辨出来，什么时候用黄芩黄连，什么时候开石膏。这个是张仲景开出来专门治疗肠胃的处方，半夏泻心汤。"}]}]}